# THE THROWER (improvement 3b; Brains `throw`, the middens' sorter). Its bite is
# a lane five tiles long, thrown from where it stands, and its tell is that lane
# on the ground for the whole windup (FightRules.tell_lane, MobFx.tell_line) with
# the arm cocked up and back over its hopper and the hopper's light climbing to
# the throw. A sorter is a worker: struck at its round, it backs off to a lane's
# length and throws. Each frame is taken while its tell is up, by day and by
# night, where the lane and its own light are all there is to read it by.
# Run at a fixed rate, so a frame costs the world no time:
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/thrower.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=knife:1 --held=knife --config=unharmed
place the_middens
zoom 9
wait 0.6
spawn sorter
try 3
  walkto part 3
  tap swing
  await tell 8
end
wait 0.45
shot 01-a-sorter-throws-down-a-lane-by-day with mob:sorter

# The same sorter, its next throw, at night: past this throw and its reload first.
hour 23
wait 2.6
await tell 8
wait 0.45
shot 02-and-by-night-its-lane-and-its-own-light with mob:sorter
